# Social Guest Inbox — agent reference

Org-scoped unified inbox at `/org/:orgSlug/inbox`. Phase 1 ships **Meta** (Facebook Messenger + Instagram DMs + comments). TikTok and Airbnb are **Coming soon** until partner APIs are available — never fake connectivity.

## Permissions

| Permission         | Capability                                  |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |
| `org:inbox:view`   | Read threads and messages                   |
| `org:inbox:reply`  | Send replies                                |
| `org:inbox:manage` | Connect channels, quick replies, automation |

Keep in sync: `supabase/functions/_shared/orgTeamPermissions.ts` and `ui/src/features/dashboard/team/lib/orgTeamConstants.ts`.

## Data scope

- Every row keyed by `organization_id`. Edge functions use `resolveOrgAccessContext(req, permission)`.
- Webhook handler is public but **must** verify `X-Hub-Signature-256` and dedupe via `social_webhook_events`.
- Tokens encrypted with `META_INBOX_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY` (AES-256-GCM, same pattern as Gmail OAuth crypto).

## Meta messaging rules

- **24-hour window:** outbound DMs only when `messaging_window_expires_at` > now (set from last inbound).
- **Comments:** public reply via Graph API; IG private reply via `recipient.comment_id` (one DM per comment, 7 days).
- **Webhook-first:** Conversations API backfill on connect only; do not poll in a loop.
- **App Review:** production requires Advanced Access — see `docs/operations/meta-app-review.md`.

## AI auto-reply

- Default mode: **suggest only** (`auto_reply_mode = draft`).
- Auto-send (`send`) requires explicit org opt-in in Automation tab.
- Never auto-reply outside Meta messaging window.
- Flag outbound AI messages with `is_ai_generated = true`.

## Edge functions

| Function                                             | Auth            |
| ---------------------------------------------------- | --------------- |
| `meta-inbox-oauth-start`                             | JWT + org       |
| `meta-inbox-oauth-callback`                          | Public redirect |
| `meta-inbox-status` / `disconnect`                   | JWT + org       |
| `meta-inbox-webhook`                                 | Public (signed) |
| `social-inbox-threads` / `messages` / `send`         | JWT + org       |
| `social-inbox-templates` / `settings` / `ai-suggest` | JWT + org       |

All JWT routes: `verify_jwt = false` in config + `serveAuthenticated` + in-handler checks.

## UI

- Feature folder: `ui/src/features/dashboard/inbox/`
- Mobile: master–detail with back button on conversation view
- Realtime: Supabase channel on `social_messages` + `social_conversations` for org id

## Don'ts

- Don't leak cross-org data in webhooks (resolve connection by `meta_page_id`).
- Don't scrape Airbnb/TikTok without official APIs.
- Don't skip route guide + `docs/PROJECT.md` updates when changing behavior.
